			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Lowballer: in the trade menu, what their items are worth and lowball offers for them (10%, 12%, 14%... under, and a smart offer that goes lower for slow sellers), typed into the coins sign with a click\n- /pv and /nw need no setup: they use Hypixel's data\n- Networth now matches SkyHelper's, priced with SkyCofl, and counts the wardrobe, equipment sets and museum\n- /pv shows your wardrobe, exact run times, extra skill levels and weapons by value\n- Item prices in tooltips come from SkyCofl\n- The fishing bite alert stays up only while the fish is biting\n\n## Install\n\n1. Minecraft 26.1.2 with Fabric Loader, Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin.\n2. Put `taz-1.3.6.jar` in your `mods` folder and remove any older `taz-*.jar`.\n3. Type `/taz` in game. Every feature starts off."
		},
