			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Player Viewer: /pv [player] opens a player viewer like NEU's, with skills, slayers, dungeons, gear, inventories and pets\n- /nw [player] says a networth: with cosmetics, without them, and unsoulbound\n- Both use data from SkyCrypt, so they need your own SkyCrypt API key: paste it in /taz → General → Player Viewer\n- Taz's /pv replaces Skyblocker's, which is still at /skyblocker pv\n\n## Install\n\n1. Minecraft 26.1.2 with Fabric Loader, Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin.\n2. Put `taz-1.3.5.jar` in your `mods` folder and remove any older `taz-*.jar`.\n3. Type `/taz` in game. Every feature starts off."
