			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Trophy Fishing reads your mana again (Hypixel draws it as an icon now), so the guide shows when Mana Rays can bite\n- Gusher countdown: Taz watches the volcano and shows when the Gusher window opens and how long is left, and knows it's Gusher time once you catch one\n- Trophy fish in your old chat logs count again when SkyHanni rewrote the catch messages\n- A higher tier counts for the ones below it: a Diamond with no Gold counts as Gold\n- Trophy Fish and Trophy Frog tables in red: names from light red (common) to dark red (legendary), and the B S G D columns light to dark\n- The low health alert works again with Hypixel's heart icon\n\n## Install\n\n1. Minecraft 26.1.2 with Fabric Loader, Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin.\n2. Put `taz-1.3.3.jar` in your `mods` folder and remove any older `taz-*.jar`.\n3. Type `/taz` in game. Every feature starts off."
