			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Critter Safari full clear mode: stay in your Hunting Hotspot and catch every critter in it for Hunting XP\n- Every critter in your hotspot glows, caught before or not, and the route takes you to each one, round the biome again and again\n- The HUD and run report count how many of each critter you caught\n\n## Install\n\n1. Minecraft 26.1.2 with Fabric Loader, Fabric API and Fabric Language Kotlin.\n2. Put `taz-1.3.2.jar` in your `mods` folder and remove any older `taz-*.jar`.\n3. Type `/taz` in game. Every feature starts off."
